    Write the appearance entry for the character in this image. Other characters in Skyrim will read it to picture this person, recognize them on sight, and remark on how they look, so it must be both accurate and vivid: the details someone would actually notice and remember, in the order they would notice them.

    **Character:** {{race}} {{gender}} (race as recorded in the game; read coloring, skin tone, and features from the image, not from the race)
